+
+# Long-rental discount: 10% off from 3 days
+
+`quote` (and so `book`, which reuses the same pricing) now charges 90% of the full price for a rental of
+3 days or more; shorter rentals keep the full price (`src/index.ts`, `price`).
+Tests: red-first for the new behaviour (discount at 3 and 10 days, none at 2 days, rounding, booking total);
+the existing 3-day quote test was updated to the reduced total. All 19 pass.
+Design choice: see dl-003-long-rental-discount-rounds-to-the-nearest-cent-applies-to-the-whole-rental-from-3-days.
